cc112bb4028c79691c8a9714708e4c1bf96fe03526bf25c86c856a3abe7a6a2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"My dragons bring news. They witnessed humans upon the High Peak, speaking of their mastery over our prides. They did not heed my dragons, unwitting of their ability to communicate with me. Now I possess this information, I must think deeply on how to proceed regarding our \"masters\". Many of my finest wyrmics wish to rise up against our deceivers, see them consumed in wyrmfire. Even some of my dragons have divulged this wish to me. Sadly, this must wait.\n\nVor's insolence will be tolerated no longer! His claims that his pride's mastery over the elements surpasses that of the dragons is insult enough, but this...! Some of my finest dragons, my glorious multi-hued wyrms, have been captured and held within their armouries in the hopes that they can further their twisted mockeries of fire and ice! This will not stand! I must ignore the plots of our human deceivers for the moment, for Vor requires my full attention.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我的巨龙带来了消息。它们在巅峰上目睹了人类，正谈论着对我们各个兽人部落的统治。他们没有防备我的巨龙，根本不知道它们能与我沟通。如今掌握了这情报，我必须深思该如何应对我们那些“主人”。我手下许多最精锐的龙战士都渴望起事反抗那些骗子，亲眼看着他们被龙火吞噬。甚至连我的一些巨龙也向我吐露过这一愿望。遗憾的是，这必须暂缓。\n\n沃尔的傲慢无礼绝不能再容忍了！他声称自己的部落对元素的掌控超越了巨龙，这已是奇耻大辱，但现在竟然……！我的一些最顶尖的巨龙，那些光辉灿烂的七彩巨龙，竟被他们捕获并关押在军械库中，妄图借此推进他们对冰火之力的扭曲亵渎！这绝不能容忍！我必须暂时将人类骗子的阴谋放到一边，因为沃尔需要我全力应对。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"69b7ee1eb66163d93563d0c70c52be30bca439eefd52a4edafd3c82bf12aa3a3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3489a9d20a46f3a1bf0f040168bdba415c4909b87bbd334f91fb842ca5efaf98","logical_entry_identity":"5849d40fc24f676066ed05ecb81d0b78fac64f1452385238b7252bb7e0cc63f8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You brought back the diamond and athame to Tannen who asked you to check the tower of Telmur, looking for a text of portals, although he is not sure it is even there. He told you to come back in a few days.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你把共鸣钻石和仪式匕首带回给泰恩；他让你去泰尔玛之塔寻找一本有关传送门的典籍，尽管他也不确定那里是否真有。他让你过几天再回来。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0811b69836d0883ec9b6fe52b70b7f6f12db89787839852ad3b65ba1134fe77f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"348f097c2816e9f8a7112d2780d7a4cf9737336f00af4e0a13bbbbbd44a3f757","logical_entry_identity":"e7f83208bf6c329ca5f486b0cb55e110c86c643547269a5f9e00bf44b41fea43","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Secrets of Telos","source_tag":"talent name","target":"泰勒斯之秘"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"148ec914be979191eab09fcde5adac1bd3700b438e13827378fe2085a041cc9a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3491121ffe0fc241ac581ece942561373dd300c94b41fbb21adaf4fd909ebc0e","logical_entry_identity":"1214c9bd0919acb602d8013f0025f59c0f4b3a01f36de727a845a1559295bd32","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"blinding powder","source_tag":"damage type","target":"致盲粉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0c6693c62f1531c7eec82864e85c93d8f5c9f2eb89f9c83dcca220e074878a4b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"34915242e123ee8e68aae9edb587e5fe07a14c73b1ff491e056a13956639a45c","logical_entry_identity":"386114f90edbcf102be17430a41d6a15e76fb3f0c233aad03f73460a0ee7ec8c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Casting beam spells has become so instinctive for you that you can now easily weave in other spells at the same time.\n\t\tAnytime you cast a beam spell there is a %d%% chance to automatically cast an offensive spell that you know.\n\t\tBeam spells duplicated by the Orb of Thaumaturgy can also trigger this effect.\n\t\tThis can only happen once (or twice with Orb of Thaumaturgy) per turn.\n\t\tThe additional cast will cost mana but no turn, will not active its cooldown and can trigger on spells currently on cooldown.\n\t\tDuring Aether Avatar only compatible spells are used.\n\n\t\tEligible spells: %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"释放射线类法术对你来说如此自然，以至于可以和其他法术穿插释放。\n每当释放射线类法术时，你有 %d%% 几率自动释放一个已习得的其他攻击类法术。\n奇术之球复制的射线类法术也能触发这一效果。\n该效果每回合只能触发一次（有奇术之球时最多触发两次）。\n额外施放会消耗法力，但不消耗回合，也不会触发法术的冷却；即使法术当前处于冷却中也可以触发。\n以太之体状态下，只会释放以太之体下能释放的技能。\n\n可触发法术：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9af8327f54e8166cffa992a23c45015e198602a307398568d5ac92bf8a790b97","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"349263c346bcb5326277668a246e65130b05757467e603902222c90500b97f52","logical_entry_identity":"56459d8c22c7effd7cf58653c877c311e875d5ed6dc2fa253ae71980b8d7adea","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"pile of tendrils","source_tag":"_t","target":"一堆卷须"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c8ec6dc9ed7e6cd0d92287f272d98a7aa36737460b51ecdc3a2ad9e42dc1e271","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"34949f1590add82914540ade559875a7f3b5b8542f64bd8dd53e5ba7c8c6fbca","logical_entry_identity":"07de3d5494c9959c3e7e46566a530af9cbc4cf853a2d06bc100d6cd07a6c10b4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"wild","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"自然"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"75711d7fc8cf0ef14366d70e03adabcfc52852e99ae7d6590f02bda757efe0a3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"349bb306758cb97b0bb4c0bd815007f0f28cf22500062155eb15f9a817b92aa4","logical_entry_identity":"8fd803a9974b9d5e6b6ee9ace1d2bfda9fd27f49f0d7ae342b707d2b0fc5d879","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"intercepts","source_tag":"_t","target":"拦截了"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5abfd552ebfd5905538132c4577bfb6d5e0a3cee57989b96d6d27f12576b328e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"349bcf2d0510151f826f23c7cc0d4a22e85a6ea943c4433a32e5ca0f8693af30","logical_entry_identity":"22d83c3d90cc4a6810a9f97a411e961f6d73c665c15011f36810ff304b363699","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You surround yourself with a radius %d distortion of time, which deals %0.2f stacking temporal damage over 3 turns to all other creatures.  The effect lasts %d turns.\n\t\tThe damage dealt will scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"以自身为中心产生半径 %d 格的时空扭曲，在 3 回合内对范围内所有其他生物造成 %0.2f 累积时空伤害。效果持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"31507511631db36ca948108f9a918ef7aacf9